indicating your personal telephone and fax numbers to enable us move ahead. Besides, this transaction is risk-free and hoped toast 7 (seven) banking days upon my elder cousinAlhaji Alike Abubakar's authorization. I thank you for your expected co-operation. God Bless you. Best Regards.MAORI HELLO._________________________________________________________ Gagné one PS2 ! Envoy un SMS Alec LE code PS Au 61166(0,35Â Hours out Du SMS)",d01,Banking and Financial Services,"GENERAL SETTINGS
